{
  "name": "@omnitron-dev/prism",
  "version": "0.3.1",
  "description": "Design System Constructor - High-level UI building blocks for complex frontends",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./dist/index.js",
  "module": "./dist/index.js",
  "types": "./dist/index.d.ts",
  "_exportsNote": "Every subpath here is backed by a tsup entry in tsup.config.ts. The globs `./components/*` and `./blocks/*` used to be here and were not: they made every component directory resolvable to TypeScript while only three of them shipped JavaScript, so an import like `@omnitron-dev/prism/components/alert` typechecked and failed in the browser — the documentation recommended that style in 55 places. `./utils` was declared with no entry at all. Add an entry to tsup.config.ts and a line here together, or not at all.",
